Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:04.00,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\frz-90\fn方正准圆_GBK\an4\pos(120,404)}やわく恋して
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:04.69,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\an9\3c&000000&\blur4}甘神でいて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.69,0:03:08.62,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\an9\3c&278BD3&\blur4}甘神でいて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:02.66,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}对轻咬示好的小猫们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:08.48,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我们由此相视而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:14.65,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我们永远如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.83,0:02:17.68,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}该是多么平静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:20.20,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是爱意袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:24.01,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越发急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:26.78,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:27.28,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:30.08,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就选你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.79,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:33.08,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「选谁都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:35.80,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.34,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.61,0:02:41.00,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小猫轻咬般你侬我侬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:46.04,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}这么直到永远就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:49.95,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&A777CA&\t(500,2400,\3c&95B990&)}倘若我们认真起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:52.59,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&A9A954&\blur4\t(300,2000,\3c&C777C3&)}心痛是在所难免的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:53.94,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&D777C3&\blur4\t(300,1200,\3c&579BE3&)}更不用说会伤害到彼此
